The In-Wall Touch Switch SLC627 allows you to remotely control your lighting or even apply schedules for automatic switching from the mobile app.

## Key Features

- ZigBee 3.0 compliant, works with any standard ZigBee hub
- Remote on/off control using your smartphone
- Set schedules to automatically power on and off
- 1/2/3 gang available for selection
- Touch screen buttons
- < 700W resistive / < 200W inductive per gang
